                    <h1 class="animate__animated animate__fadeInUp animate__delay-1s text-center mt-3">Solo en Macondo y
                        Nicaragua:<br><span>Los absurdos del r&eacute;gimen Ortega-Murillo</span>
                    </h1>
                </div>

            </div>
